commit 4996ceb863a70c5a9ab48c783f8907635215f0e4
Author: stranske <stranske@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Sep 20 03:41:00 2026 -0500

    fix(verifier): prefer scoped App token for follow-up issues (#3490)
    
    * fix(verifier): prefer scoped App token for follow-up dispatch
    
    Isolates the two-workflow token change proposed in iamkayleb/Workflows#3446 on current main. Pins the App action, limits repository and API grants, retains PAT and workflow-token fallbacks, and documents the explicit dispatch behavior.
    
    * fix(verifier): omit unused pull request App grant
    
    * fix(verifier): separate model token and constrain App key
    
    ---------
    
    Co-authored-by: closer-lane <automation@stranske.dev>

